            "review_text": "TeeForsta\nManukau, New Zealand105 contributions\n0\nEverything so delicious, good price, they always gave me a discount!\nJun 2023 • Solo\nI went there a few times while I was in Hanoi. I'm actually still here and will go again before I leave. I think they realised I was a return customer and gave me a discount each time! Their prices were cheap already! Everything I tried was delicious and a good break away from the heat with the fans going on full.\nThis place is so good, I was never harassed, they didn't ask me to do this review (!!) - lots of places do ask to boost their numbers. This is the genuine, real deal place in the Old Quarter. Excellent!!\nRead more\nWritten June 11, 2023",
